{
  "v": 6,
  "id": "84d7ca63-4f25-4254-b264-1b774009795f",
  "title": "2. 과업 관리 방안 — 산출물 관리체계",
  "canvas": {
    "w": 1280,
    "h": 905
  },
  "source": {
    "kind": "kg-html",
    "html": "<section class=\"kg-slide kg-root\" data-screen-label=\"산출물 품질관리형\">\n  <header class=\"kg-header\">\n    <div class=\"kg-header__media\"></div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__num kg-section-num\">02</div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__divider\"></div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__titles\">\n      <div class=\"kg-section-title\">과업 관리 방안</div>\n      <div class=\"kg-section-sub\">산출물 관리체계 · 품질검토 절차</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"kg-chapter-tab\">\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tab__roman\">III</span>\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tab__sep\"></span>\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tag\">과업 품질 관리</span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"kg-msgband\"><span class=\"kg-msgband__mark\"></span>\n    <p class=\"kg-message\">산출물을 담당자·팀 단위·수행책임자 3단계로 검토하고 등록과 변경사항을 모니터링</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"kg-body-area\">\n    <div class=\"kg-content s-halves\">\n\n      <!-- ================= 좌 : 품질관리 프로세스 ================= -->\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"kg-subtopic\">품질관리 프로세스</div>\n        <div class=\"col__b\">\n          <div class=\"proc\">\n\n            <div class=\"prow\">\n              <div class=\"pchev\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">품질관리대상<br>정의</div>\n              <div class=\"pcell\"><div class=\"plist\">\n                <span data-kg-role=\"body3\">단계별 산출물 목록을 종합하여 품질관리 대상 정의</span>\n              </div></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"prow\">\n              <div class=\"pchev\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">산출물 품질<br>평가기준 정의</div>\n              <div class=\"pcell\"><div class=\"plist\">\n                <span data-kg-role=\"body3\">산출물 작성 지침 준수 여부, 내용 완성도 등 품질 평가기준 정의</span>\n              </div></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"prow\">\n              <div class=\"pchev\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">산출물 품질<br>검토</div>\n              <div class=\"pcell\"><div class=\"plist\">\n                <span data-kg-role=\"body3\">완료일정 준수 검토</span>\n                <span data-kg-role=\"body3\">절차 및 표준 준수 여부와 요구사항 충족 여부 검토</span>\n              </div></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"prow\">\n              <div class=\"pchev\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">검토의견서 작성<br>및 수정요청</div>\n              <div class=\"pcell\"><div class=\"plist\">\n                <span data-kg-role=\"body3\">검토의견서 작성</span>\n                <span data-kg-role=\"body3\">수정·보완사항에 대하여 담당자와 협의를 통하여 변경 또는 현안 관리</span>\n              </div></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"prow\">\n              <div class=\"pchev\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">산출물 등록 및<br>변경사항 모니터링</div>\n              <div class=\"pcell\"><div class=\"plist\">\n                <span data-kg-role=\"body3\">공식 산출물 등록</span>\n                <span data-kg-role=\"body3\">수정·보완사항에 대한 반영 여부 모니터링</span>\n              </div></div>\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ================= 우 : 내부·외부 검토 ================= -->\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"kg-subtopic\">내부·외부 검토</div>\n        <div class=\"col__b\">\n          <div class=\"rev\">\n\n            <div class=\"plan\">\n              <div class=\"pcard pcard--a\">\n                <div class=\"pcard__h\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">프로젝트 일정 수립</div>\n                <div class=\"pcard__b\">\n                  <span data-kg-role=\"body3\">업무 성격과 상호 연관관계를 고려한 일정 수립 및 주공정(Critical Path) 정의</span>\n                  <span data-kg-role=\"body3\">계획·일정에 대한 변경을 반영, 기준선(Baseline) 관리 병행</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"updown\"><span></span></div>\n\n              <div class=\"pcard pcard--b\">\n                <div class=\"pcard__h\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">진척도 일 단위 점검</div>\n                <div class=\"pcard__b\">\n                  <span data-kg-role=\"body3\">업무수행상의 주공정을 일 단위로 진척 점검</span>\n                  <div class=\"fig\">\n                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 370\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n                      <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"300\" height=\"370\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--paper)\"></rect>\n\n                      <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"104\" height=\"26\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\"></rect>\n                      <text x=\"52\" y=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">수행 과제</text>\n                      <rect x=\"104\" y=\"0\" width=\"196\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#2C5184\"></rect>\n                      <text x=\"202\" y=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">계약체결일 ~ 2026.12.31</text>\n                      <rect x=\"104\" y=\"13\" width=\"196\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#5A86BE\"></rect>\n                      <g font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                        <text x=\"124\" y=\"23\">1월</text><text x=\"163\" y=\"23\">2월</text><text x=\"202\" y=\"23\">3월</text>\n                        <text x=\"241\" y=\"23\">4월</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"23\">5월</text>\n                      </g>\n\n                      <g stroke=\"var(--neutral-200)\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n                        <path d=\"M0 60 H300\"></path><path d=\"M0 94 H300\"></path><path d=\"M0 128 H300\"></path><path d=\"M0 162 H300\"></path>\n                        <path d=\"M0 196 H300\"></path><path d=\"M0 230 H300\"></path><path d=\"M0 264 H300\"></path><path d=\"M0 298 H300\"></path>\n                        <path d=\"M0 332 H300\"></path>\n                        <path d=\"M104 26 V370\"></path><path d=\"M143 26 V370\"></path><path d=\"M182 26 V370\"></path>\n                        <path d=\"M221 26 V370\"></path><path d=\"M260 26 V370\"></path>\n                      </g>\n\n                      <g font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"var(--ink-700)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                        <text x=\"5\" y=\"47\">대내외 환경 분석</text>\n                        <text x=\"5\" y=\"81\">내부역량 진단</text>\n                        <text x=\"5\" y=\"115\">벤치마킹·종합진단</text>\n                        <text x=\"5\" y=\"149\">사업·산업구조 분석</text>\n                        <text x=\"5\" y=\"183\">이해관계자 진단</text>\n                        <text x=\"5\" y=\"217\">가치체계 정립</text>\n                        <text x=\"5\" y=\"251\">전략목표·과제 도출</text>\n                        <text x=\"5\" y=\"285\">성과지표 설계</text>\n                        <text x=\"5\" y=\"319\">운영·조직 설계</text>\n                        <text x=\"5\" y=\"353\">보고·품질관리</text>\n                      </g>\n\n                      <g fill=\"#5A86BE\">\n                        <rect x=\"106\" y=\"36\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                        <rect x=\"120\" y=\"70\" width=\"64\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                        <rect x=\"140\" y=\"104\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                        <rect x=\"158\" y=\"138\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                        <rect x=\"176\" y=\"172\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                        <rect x=\"196\" y=\"206\" width=\"64\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                        <rect x=\"214\" y=\"240\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                        <rect x=\"232\" y=\"274\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                        <rect x=\"248\" y=\"308\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                      </g>\n                      <rect x=\"106\" y=\"342\" width=\"186\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#B7BFC9\"></rect>\n                      <text x=\"199\" y=\"353\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">전 기간 상시</text>\n\n                      <path d=\"M108 350 C152 344 190 302 224 216 C250 148 274 84 292 44\" stroke=\"var(--red-500)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\"></path>\n                      <g fill=\"var(--red-500)\">\n                        <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"334\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"224\" cy=\"216\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"292\" cy=\"44\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n                      </g>\n                      <g font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--red-600)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                        <text x=\"156\" y=\"330\">20%</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"202\">60%</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"end\">100%</text>\n                      </g>\n                    </svg>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"esc\">\n              <div class=\"escbox\">\n                <div class=\"eu\">\n                  <span class=\"eu__k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">담당자</span>\n                  <div class=\"eu__b\">\n                    <span class=\"eu__t\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">산출물 작업 완료</span>\n                    <span class=\"eu__d\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">작성 지침에 따라 초안 작성</span>\n                    <span class=\"eu__d\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">수치·출처 자체 점검</span>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"edown\"></div>\n                <div class=\"eu\">\n                  <span class=\"eu__k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">모듈 리더</span>\n                  <div class=\"eu__b\">\n                    <span class=\"eu__t\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">팀 단위 품질 검토</span>\n                    <span class=\"eu__d\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">모듈 내 논리·근거 검토</span>\n                    <span class=\"eu__d\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">모듈 간 중복·상충 확인</span>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"edown\"></div>\n                <div class=\"eu\">\n                  <span class=\"eu__k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">수행책임자</span>\n                  <div class=\"eu__b\">\n                    <span class=\"eu__t\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">최종 품질 검토</span>\n                    <span class=\"eu__d\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">과업 요구사항 충족 확인</span>\n                    <span class=\"eu__d\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">발주기관 제출본 확정</span>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"done\">\n                <span class=\"edown\"></span>\n                <span class=\"done__o\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">산출물<br>완성</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer class=\"kg-footer\">\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__src\">JDC 중장기 경영전략체계 진단 및 수립 — 산출물 품질관리 절차 및 검토 계층</span>\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__page\">47</span>\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__logo\"><img src=\"/kg/assets/keynes-group-logo.png\" alt=\"Keynes Group\"></span>\n  </footer>\n</section>",
    "css": ".kg-content{margin-top:12px;}\n  .col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;}\n  .col__b{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;}\n\n  /* ---- 좌 : 세로 셰브론 순서도 ---- */\n  .proc{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-evenly;min-height:0;}\n  .prow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:158px 1fr;gap:14px;align-items:stretch;}\n  .pchev{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2C5184,#1F497D);color:#fff;\n    font-size:14px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.22;padding:11px 10px 18px;\n    clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,100% 74%,50% 100%,0 74%);}\n  .pcell{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:0;}\n  .plist{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;}\n  .plist span{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:7px;\n    font-size:14px;line-height:1.26;color:var(--ink-900);}\n  .plist span::before{content:\"\";flex:0 0 auto;width:5px;height:5px;margin-top:6px;\n    background:var(--ink-navy);border-radius:1px;}\n\n  /* ---- 우 : 일정관리 + 검토 계층 ---- */\n  .rev{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr 1fr;gap:13px;min-height:0;}\n\n  .plan{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;gap:0;}\n  .pcard{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;\n    border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:4px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;}\n  .pcard--a{flex:0 0 auto;}\n  .pcard--b{flex:1;}\n  .pcard__h{text-align:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2C5184,#1F497D);padding:6px 10px;}\n  .pcard__b{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:8px 10px;min-height:0;}\n  .pcard__b span{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:7px;\n    font-size:14px;line-height:1.26;color:var(--ink-900);font-weight:700;}\n  .pcard__b span::before{content:\"\";flex:0 0 auto;width:5px;height:5px;margin-top:6px;\n    background:var(--navy-800);border-radius:1px;}\n  .fig{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n    border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:3px;background:var(--neutral-050);padding:4px;}\n  .fig svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;}\n\n  .updown{flex:0 0 34px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}\n  .updown span{position:relative;width:20px;height:26px;background:var(--gray-300);\n    clip-path:polygon(50% 0,100% 24%,72% 24%,72% 76%,100% 76%,50% 100%,0 76%,28% 76%,28% 24%,0 24%);}\n\n  /* 빗금 검토 계층 */\n  .esc{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;}\n  .escbox{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-evenly;min-height:0;\n    gap:0;padding:9px 11px;border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:4px;\n    background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,var(--hatch) 0 1px,transparent 1px 6px),#fff;}\n  .eu{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:3px;}\n  .eu__k{text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-700);}\n  .eu__b{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;padding:8px 9px;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#EDEFF2,#DCE0E6);border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);\n    border-radius:3px;}\n  .eu__t{text-align:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-navy);line-height:1.2;\n    padding-bottom:5px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-300);}\n  .eu__d{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:6px;\n    font-size:13px;line-height:1.22;color:var(--ink-700);}\n  .eu__d::before{content:\"\";flex:0 0 auto;width:4px;height:4px;margin-top:5px;\n    background:var(--navy-800);border-radius:1px;}\n  .edown{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:16px;}\n  .edown::after{content:\"\";width:0;height:0;border-left:6px solid transparent;\n    border-right:6px solid transparent;border-top:9px solid var(--gray-400);}\n  .done{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0;padding-top:6px;}\n  .done__o{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;\n    width:118px;height:62px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--neutral-100);\n    border:2px solid var(--gray-400);font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-navy);line-height:1.2;}",
    "origin": "47_Deliverable_QA.html"
  },
